<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One, Advanta.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One, Advanta.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co added Capital One Financial Corp and Advanta Corp to its recommended list, an Oppenheimer source said.</p>
<p>-- Capital One gained 1-1/8 to 39-1/2 and Advanta gained 3-12/16 to 52-7/16.</p>
</text>
